{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The first controlled action test identifies color 9 at `(14,51)` as the avatar: action 3 moves it one node left, while blocked actions only consume the visible budget. Four color-12 objects move simultaneously on that successful turn, so this is a cooperative/dynamic maze configuration with a color-14 goal. I’m reducing the frame to parsed maze nodes and testing whether the existing dynamic-maze leg can solve this configuration unchanged."}}
